    "runtimeProperties": {},
    "layoutPolicy": "The three pinned wrappers are unstyled primitives. This reference adopts the native compact 32px header, 16px inline inset and 8px stack gap; content height and width remain intrinsic. No card, chevron, animation, invented variant or fixed source instance width is implied. A composed Button may replace the trigger through the actual render API; its own chrome then belongs to that composition.",
